<title>UK: Santander unit sets $150 million FRN due 2007.</title>
<headline>Santander unit sets $150 million FRN due 2007.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SANTENDER FINANCIAL ISSUANCES LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BANCO DE SANTANDER SA DE CREDITO</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    13.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +25 BP    PAY DATE    13.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.708    FULL FEES   0.40</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.708</p>
<p> NOTES	SPREAD AT LAUNCH 3M LIBOR +29 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/SP/CI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SPAIN     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	SUBORDINATED ISSUE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
